{title: I’ve got the Holy Ghost}

{comment: Chorus}
I’ve got the Holy Ghost down in my soul
Just like the Bible said
I’ve got that Holy Ghost down in my soul
Just like the Bible said
I’ve been to the water and I’ve been baptized
My soul got happy and I’m satisfied
I wouldn’t trade nothing for my journey now
Just like the Bible, just like the Bible
Just like the Bible said

{comment: Chorus 2}
I read in the Bible where Jesus said,
You must be born again.
You must repent and be baptized
For the remissions of your sins.
I went to the alter and I cried, “oh Lord,
Forgive my sin and save my soul.”
The spirit came down and filled me then,
Just like the Bible, just like the Bible,
Just like the Bible said.
